1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,471
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,471 --> 00:00:14,322
When a question says describe the internal structure of an organ, walk inwards in exactly this order: epidermis, then the ground tissue, then the vascular tissue, then the centre.

3
00:00:14,322 --> 00:00:19,023
You will never miss a layer, and your answer will read like a real section.

